  user_2,[00:00] Hi Aditya this is Vikram Patel from Omni Insurance Group calling about your home insurance policy. Can you hear me okay?
  user_1,[00:10] Uh yeah I can hear you. Hi Vikram.
  user_2,[00:20] Great I just wanted to confirm a few details so we can get your policy active today.
  user_1,[00:25] Sure what do you need?
  user_2,[00:30] Can you confirm the address of the property? It's 24/5 Green Valley Apartments Bangalore?
  user_1,[00:40] Um-- actually it's 24/5 Green Valley but the street is uh 12th Main Road Bangalore 560001.
  user_2,[00:50] Got it thanks. And the type of construction? Is it a concrete frame?
  user_1,[00:55] Yes it's an RCC structure two BHK.
  user_2,[01:05] Perfect. Let me pull up the quote. [typing] ... Looks good. The premium is INR twelve thousand five hundred per annum payable annually. Does that work for you?
  user_1,[01:10] Yeah that's fine.
  user_2,[01:15] Alright I'll go ahead and set the policy status to Active. You'll receive the policy documents via email shortly. Anything else you need?
  user_1,[01:20] No that's all. Thanks!